    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2531781157",
      "Source": "Requires Wood, Thatch, or Sparkpowder to activate.  Can craft special modded items and is x5 faster.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"需要木材、茅草或火花粉来激活。可以制作特殊模组物品，且速度是5倍。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1780976297",
      "Source": "These incredibly sharp Toxic metal spikes have got  x10 the health of normal spikes and blocks most creatures from walking over it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些极其锋利的毒系金属尖刺的生命值是普通尖刺的10倍，并且能阻止大多数生物从上面走过！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::195283556",
      "Source": "These incredibly sharp Alpha metal spikes have got  x20 the health of normal spikes and blocks bigger creatures from walking over it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些极其锋利的精英金属尖刺的生命值是普通尖刺的20倍，并且能阻止更大的生物从上面走过！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1734640216",
      "Source": "These incredibly sharp Mythic metal spikes have got  x40 the health of normal spikes and blocks ALL creatures from walking over it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些极其锋利的神话金属尖刺的生命值是普通尖刺的40倍，并且能阻止所有生物从上面走过！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::529292385",
      "Source": "A medium-caliber modern bullet, used for alpha auto turrets",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种中口径现代子弹，用于精英自动炮塔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::219577566",
      "Source": "A medium-caliber modern bullet, used for elemental auto turrets",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种中口径现代子弹，用于元素自动炮塔","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1182225905",
      "Source": "Used in kibble recipes!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"用于饲料配方！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4233195296",
      "Source": "Used to fertilize crops. Yields 5 times the manure as vanilla fertilizer.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"用于给作物施肥。产生的肥料是原版肥料的5倍。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1045067508",
      "Source": "These sturdy bones harvested from Resurrected can be used for bonemeals or high end kibbles!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些从复活生物身上收获的坚固骨骼可用于制作骨粉或高端饲料！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4049247846",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>This Tier of Bosses is not summonable! You can find this Boss in the wild!<#RN#><#RN#>Keep in mind, this Boss can be vicious! It will give you good loot depending on its level!<#RN#><#RN#>As you fight it, you will notice that once it reached 10% of its health a timer will go off, if you keep it alive during that time, it will upgrade to its next level of quality, giving you better loot. <#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>这一阶的Boss无法召唤！你可以在野外找到它！<#RN#><#RN#>记住，这个Boss很凶残！它会根据自身等级掉落不错的 loot！<#RN#><#RN#>当你与它战斗时，会注意到当它的生命值降到10%时会触发计时器，若你在这段时间内让它存活，它会升级到下一品质等级，掉落更优的 loot！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::723322021",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Bones... <#RN#><#RN#>Squaky bones<#RN#><#RN#>Squaky and old bones.<#RN#><#RN#>Yes i know very helpfull.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>These Bosses cannot be summoned! They can only be found in the wild.<#RN#><#RN#>Not hard to find, just listen for the really creepy ark music.<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>骨头…<#RN#><#RN#>吱呀作响的骨头<#RN#><#RN#>又老又吱呀的骨头。<#RN#><#RN#>对，我知道这很有用。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>这些Boss无法召唤！只能在野外找到。<#RN#><#RN#>不难找，只要听那种超恐怖的方舟音乐就行。<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2245116262",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Alright i will be helpfull one last time.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>These are creatures out of your nightmares!<#RN#><#RN#>Extremely dangerous, make sure you are prepared!<#RN#><#RN#>Make sure you have visited your old friend, mr.LootBoss! He might be able to help you out!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>好吧，我最后帮你一次。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>这些是你噩梦里的生物！<#RN#><#RN#>极度危险，务必做好准备！<#RN#><#RN#>一定要去见见你的老朋友——LootBoss先生！他说不定能帮上忙！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1124093076",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>.................<#RN#><#RN#>Death....Death...Death....Death.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Only Death is awaiting you.<#RN#>You are on your own, im out.<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>………………<#RN#><#RN#>死亡…死亡…死亡…死亡。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>等待你的只有死亡。<#RN#>你只能靠自己了，我溜了。<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3355756337",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Ah, the elemental Bosses!<#RN#><#RN#>These Bosses are all about the right element!<#RN#><#RN#>Hint Hint<#RN#><#RN#>Depending on which element you are fighting againts it could go good or bad for you.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Ever, played pokemon before... ?<#RN#>Hint Hint<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>You will need to kill these guardians to unlock the next kibble!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>啊，元素Boss！<#RN#><#RN#>这些Boss的关键在于选对元素！<#RN#><#RN#>提示提示<#RN#><#RN#>根据你对抗的元素不同，结果对你来说可能好坏不一。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>你玩过宝可梦吗…？<#RN#>提示提示<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>你需要杀死这些守护者才能解锁下一阶 kibble！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1378250472",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>The primals huh...<#RN#><#RN#>Now these creatures you dont want to mess with!<#RN#>Though ofcourse if you dont, you cant progress so you got no choice, heh...<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>These creatures are not summonable, you will need to find them in the wild!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>I would definitely prepare some health potions!<#RN#>I hear the fabled and mythic dinos might be able to help you with that! <#RN#><#RN#>They drop some delicious loot!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>原始生物啊…<#RN#><#RN#>这些生物你绝对不想招惹！<#RN#>但当然了，不招惹的话你就无法推进，所以你别无选择，呵…<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>这些生物无法召唤，你得去野外找！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>我绝对会准备一些治疗药水！<#RN#>我听说传说和神话级恐龙可能能帮到你！<#RN#><#RN#>它们会掉落一些超棒的 loot！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，生存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2065141960",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>In need for artifacts?<#RN#><#RN#>No ? yes ? well, the next tier of Bosses will require alot of artifacts!<#RN#><#RN#>Now you could go into the caves, but we are talking about alottttt of artifacts...<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>This Boss, will drop alot of artifacts upon death...<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>需要神器吗？<#RN#><#RN#>不需要？需要？好吧，下一层级的 Boss 需要大量神器！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>这个 Boss 死亡后会掉落大量神器……<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4151592884",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Wow... Already at the origins, well i guess you are no longer a beach bob...<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>For these i hope you are prepared!<#RN#><#RN#>I would definitely atleast have a few health potions of each so you can cycle through them!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>哇……已经到起源了，看来你不再是海滩新手了……<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>对于这些，我希望你已经做好准备！<#RN#><#RN#>我绝对会至少准备每种治疗药水各几瓶，这样你可以轮换使用！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3669248384",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Now we are getting into some dangerous seas!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>These Bosses are no joke!<#RN#><#RN#>I hope you have prepared some gooood quality saddles, you will need them!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Remember, the lootBoss from Tier1 can give you some good items! Depending on which level you grinded at.<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>现在我们要进入一片危险海域了！<#RN#><#RN#>这些Boss可不好惹！<#RN#><#RN#>我希望你已经准备了一些高质量的鞍具，你会需要它们的！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>记住，Tier1的 lootBoss 能给你一些好东西！具体取决于你刷到的等级。<#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1060754613",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>You have come so far..<#RN#><#RN#>This will be a tough one!<#RN#><#RN#>Butt you are a strong survivor now! You dont need me tell you what happens.<#RN#>I will let you go in blind!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>你已经走了这么远..<#RN#><#RN#>这会是一场硬仗！<#RN#><#RN#>不过你现在是个强大的幸存者了！你不需要我告诉你会发生什么。<#RN#>我会让你自己去摸索！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2995429320",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Smash, smash, smash, smash, and a little bit of growling too, maybe alot.<#RN#><#RN#>Have fun..<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>These Bosses will unlock the Spirit And Chaos kibble!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>砸，砸，砸，砸，再加点咆哮，也许很多咆哮。<#RN#><#RN#>玩得开心..<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>这些Boss会解锁灵魂与混沌 kibble！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::609474905",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>Again, big smash smash growl, uhh smash. Okay this is getting old.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Titans. Kill them.<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>再强调一遍，就是狂砸、怒吼，呃，砸就完了。这说辞都听腻了。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>泰坦龙。杀了它们。<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2206639476",
      "Source": "Will provide 5% health per second for 10 Seconds long! After use it has a 20 second cooldown!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每秒恢复5%生命值，持续10秒！使用后有20秒冷却时间！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2585811267",
      "Source": "Will provide 10% health per second for 20 Seconds long!<#RN#>After use it has a 40 second cooldown!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每秒恢复10%生命值，持续20秒！<#RN#>使用后有40秒冷却时间！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::718300285",
      "Source": "Will provide 15% health per second for 40 Seconds long! After use it has a 80 second cooldown!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每秒恢复15%生命值，持续40秒！使用后有80秒冷却时间！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::860880245",
      "Source": "Will provide 20% health per second for 50 Seconds long! After use it has a 100 second cooldown! This is the best heath potion you can find! Watch out for its side effects!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每秒恢复20%生命值，持续50秒！使用后有100秒冷却时间！这是你能找到的最佳生命药剂！注意它的副作用！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
