    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1066244832",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#>So you would like to tame an origin?<#RN#><#RN#>These beasts are known to be very resistant againts tranqs!<#RN#><#RN#>I heard you will need to damage them alot in order to tranq them!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Kibble can be found  from Mr.Artifact The Original!<#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">助手指南</><#RN#><#RN#>你想驯服一只起源生物？<#RN#><#RN#>这些野兽以对镇静剂极强的抗性著称！<#RN#><#RN#>我听说你需要对它们造成大量伤害才能将其镇静！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Kibble 可从原始神器先生处获得！<#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2382432610",
      "Source": "<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Helpers Guide</><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>Nightmares can be obtained by evolving your origin into a nightmare!<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Goodluck Survivor!</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">帮手指南</><#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>噩梦可通过将你的起源进化为噩梦来获取！<#RN#><#RN#><#RN#>  <RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">祝你好运，幸存者！</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
